  "title": "Jazzy Grilled Portuguese Kielbasa Skewers",
  "description": "Savory, slightly spicy skewers featuring Portuguese kielbasa, bell peppers, onions, and cilantro, all grilled to perfection.",
  "cuisine": "portuguese",
