      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "olive oil",
      "amount": "1/4 cup"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat (400°F).",
    "Thread kielbasa, bell peppers, onions, and cilantro onto skewers.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together lemon juice, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the mixture evenly onto both sides of the skewers.",
    "Brush the grill grates with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning every 2 minutes.",
    "Remove the skewers from the grill and let rest for 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the skewers hot and enjoy!"
  ],
